  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CATJ Core support 2022-26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Wealth tax campaign, focusing on parliamentarians
- Building support for tax justice amongst churches
- Working with tax justice organisations in support of fairer tax policies.&#xa0;&#xa0;
During the implementation of the project, Christian Aid and Just Money Movement agreed to extend our joint work beyond tax to also work on investment in line with each organisation&apos;s piorities. This is reflected by a larger grant, extending the project to tie in with the Partnership period (to 2026) and with greater engagement by JMM in our economic justice work, particularly on business and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
